)$ is continuous at $x=5$ and $f(5)=2,$ then what is the value of\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 5}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}-25f(x)}\\,?\n$$" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282968 1113 #uuid "c90ff895-7a2f-5133-9a57-0160b2c4493e" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282968 1145 "We're told that $f(x)$ is continuous at $x=5.$ According to the definition of continuity, this means that ${lim}_{x\\to 5}f(x)$ exists and\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 5}f(x)=f(5)=2.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 5}\\sqrt{{x}^{3}-25f(x)} & =\\sqrt{{5}^{3}-25\\cdot 2} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{75} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282970 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282971 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282972 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282973 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282974 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1041 "selection" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1104 #edb/ref 17592186282972 13194139534241 true] [17592186282969 1110 #uuid "34e8146f-d5ef-5dd8-a4ef-ca02d25ebb95" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282970 1034 "10\\sqrt{3}" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282970 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534241 true] [17592186282970 1111 #uuid "a0d614d0-b4c9-5312-a663-abdd8b0fc55e" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282971 1034 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282971 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534241 true] [17592186282971 1111 #uuid "2b00a938-df83-5304-b348-a337b474bc3f" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282972 1034 "5\\sqrt{3}" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282972 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534241 true] [17592186282972 1111 #uuid "f7c95a83-2e23-5610-96ca-3ba1c9ebd916" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282973 1034 "0" 13194139534241 true] [17592186282973 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534241 true] [17592186282973 1111 #uuid "fe414019-f13f-56b9-